# MuleCatch Frontend Configuration
# Copy to .env and adjust values as needed.

# ── API Connection ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# In development (npm start), leave this empty — CRA proxy handles routing.
# In production (npm run build + static serve), set this to your backend URL.
#
# Examples:
#   Development (default): leave unset or empty
#   Production (same machine): REACT_APP_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
#   Production (remote):       REACT_APP_API_URL=https://api.mulecatch.example.com
REACT_APP_API_URL=
